      "content": "it does feel like a struggle. just constantly trying to force myself to matter when everything feels so empty. if i just... let go, like you're saying, it wouldn't even be a disruption. just a quiet exit. do you really think it's okay to feel that way? like, to just want the silence to be permanent?",
